      "lang": "en-gb",
      "metaDescription": " Featured Extensions JA Comment Component     We are proud to introduce JA Comment Component, a brand new and powerful comment system for Joomla! 1.5 and above. It provides a quick way to let your readers post comments on your content pages or provide valuable feedback.... Read more JA Extensions Manager    A must have extension. Now manage Joomla extensions / templates upgrades or rollback in an efficient way. Now supports upgrade, rollback, remote install, internal repository and file comparison between versions... Read more JA Compress    This plugin, enables optimization / compression of CSS and JS files for Joomla. It provides functionality to use any of the two effective open source libraries one is Minify and another one is SmartOptimizer...  Read more JA BookMark Plugin    JA BookMark Plugin is a simple but powerful plugin, which allows seamless integration of AddThis or AddToAny BookMarking services into Joomla! articles. Check live demo... Read more JA Google Map    JA Google Map Plugin allows to embed Google Maps, into articles. A step further, it comes with Code Generator, which allows generation of multiple maps with varied configurations and layouts... Read more JA Google Translate Plugin    JA Google Translate lets you add google translate feature to individual articles without refreshing the page or redirecting to google translate url. Translation happens on the fly... Read more JA Showcase    The JA Showcase component supports up to 10 content types for showcase presentation, including image, html, slideshow caption, slideshow controlbar, iframe, flash, module, modules, item and ajax... Read more JA Highslide    Highslide is a brilliant thumbnail viewer. The plugin makes use of a Joomla! quicktag to facilitate the integration and supports many types of content, ranging from images, contents, html, iframe to flash or ajax. ... Read more JA Flowlist    This module loads external images with title and hyperlink from selected categories or sections and creating a 3D flow animation. It allow you to show images from a folder in images folder of site root... Read more JA Tabs    This module enables to load specified modules, categories, contents and even your own defined text, rendered flexibly in tabs with fading effect, or displayed in horizontal or vertical block... Read more Disqus Debate Echo Comment    it integrates IntenseDebate, Disqus or Echo (erstwhile js-kit) commenting system into Joomla! articles. Easy to use and configure. Supports enable / disable selected categories or individual articles... Read more JA Gform Component    Coming up soon.... Enterprise extensions (To be purchased separately..) JA Voice     Unique approach away from traditional emails or forums, enabling feedbacks from users in an organized structure, where ideas can be commented, voted up/down in a transparent way... Read more JA Job Board     Joomla extension enabling running a full featured Job site, allows management of resumes, job offering, applications, payments and subscriptions. Run a job site within your Joomla... Read more Please Note : JA JobBoard Component and JA Voice  Extensions are NOT released under JAEC. These extensions are Enterprise  level and are single purchases. Sign up &amp;amp; Pricing JA Extensions Club Info {jacomment off}",
